                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.00/178: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-02-06T13:00:00-03:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 6,
                                1921—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 4:45 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>12. Department’s February 4, 1 p.m. Brazilian Government will recognize the new
                    Bolivian Government conjointly on February 9.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
